  "statement": "Let $\\mathcal A$ and $\\mathcal B$ be abelian categories [def-sp-abelian] with derived categories and K-injective resolutions. For an additive functor $F:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B$ [def-sp-left-exact-additive], its unbounded right derived functor $RF:D(\\mathcal A)\\to D(\\mathcal B)$, constructed from K-injectives, has a natural commutation with integer shifts and carries distinguished triangles to distinguished triangles [def-weil-triangulated-category].",
